      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGM-202 KKKJJJ&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 2 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGM-2 body, which is a flexible mainstay anti-ship missile.  This missile will deliver no payload.  It homes in on its target using command guidance from its launching ship.

